[{"client_msg_id":"4b54202e-c630-493f-b892-aafb7ee4aca7","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"泣いた","ts":"1635515556.057600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+msIN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"840201b0-cf13-48e7-9206-9f7585b59c12","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"金曜ロードショウでバイオレットエヴァーガーデン見てるです","ts":"1635509187.057400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tTg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17FB48A7-6A38-4084-AA15-1976C25D5178","type":"message","user":"U02FEUMBYJ2","text":"声優の話になると思い出すのが、風立ちぬの主人公の声優を誰に決めるかの会議で宮崎さんと鈴木さんが「庵野いいかもしれないね」とか言い出した時のスタッフさんの顔ですね。本当に虚無の表情になっていて申し訳ないけどいつ見ても笑ってしまう","ts":"1635490969.056500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EoZS0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5D05F837-59F0-4451-A4DE-6C6AD8FA0C31","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"イケボって有名なレベルになるともう人生がカッコよくないとダメなのかなあれ？","ts":"1635487546.052200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G5=u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29478c3f-d21b-4017-a417-06c3fd79d08a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"それだけで声優になれるもんじゃあない。","ts":"1635486748.049900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p8K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d35c19a5-afdd-4c0c-aa5d-2c335086fea3","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"それはそれとして素人でも声がよければだいぶちやほやされる世の中ではある","ts":"1635486733.049600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lrYIc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2384ed2b-9d34-42ed-97bb-77e8efae7976","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"さっき「声優すげぇ」ってなったやつ。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/junokuno/status/1453944510740791301\u003e","ts":"1635486140.049100","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/junokuno|@junokuno\u003e: 吹き替えになったら俄然良くなってる。クソ作品だったとしても公開初日に徹夜してでも観るんだろうけど。アニメ版のシーンがたくさん出ているのでストーリーはアニメ準拠なんだろyな：アニメ版の声優が勢揃い！ 実写版『カウボーイビパップ』の吹き替え版予告編がついに公開 \u003chttps://www.gizmodo.jp/2021/10/netflix-cowboy-bebop.html\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"オクノ総研総裁@リモート義体","author_subname":"@junokuno","author_link":"https://twitter.com/junokuno/status/1453944510740791301","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1373121790071894017/kbTXFW8e_normal.jpg","text":"吹き替えになったら俄然良くなってる。クソ作品だったとしても公開初日に徹夜してでも観るんだろうけど。アニメ版のシーンがたくさん出ているのでストーリーはアニメ準拠なんだろyな：アニメ版の声優が勢揃い！ 実写版『カウボーイビパップ』の吹き替え版予告編がついに公開 \u003chttps://www.gizmodo.jp/2021/10/netflix-cowboy-bebop.html\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1635482359,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/junokuno/status/1453944510740791301","original_url":"https://twitter.com/junokuno/status/1453944510740791301"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r=cz2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"649666e6-d233-43b9-82b1-7bedd49cc22c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あの声が旦那さんの体調不良の原因とかいう話があったようななかったような","ts":"1635485645.048800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sbH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"917A9329-68FC-4A04-84A0-BB34684DCFF6","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"金朋、声で超音波が出るって・・・","ts":"1635485619.048400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qu2x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e588fb23-3ff3-4203-9684-73e69c0e2dc1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"その意味でいうと野沢雅子さんはすごい","ts":"1635485496.047500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EQn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f3b73a0-dc25-4701-994f-b5cc0a5f87e8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あとは、同じ声を出し続けられるかとかも重要かも…？","ts":"1635485255.047100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IkQh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3266e4a-85a7-4f71-bc45-95290245eb54","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"マイクが拾えない高周波...があるとかなんとか","ts":"1635485162.045800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NZp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29a99708-5f4d-48d4-b017-ff20bb81dcfd","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"マイク乗りはつまるところ\n• 声の出し方(呼吸法、響きのつくりかた…)\n• 自分の得意な周波数帯の把握\n• 位置取り\nとか結構技術と理詰めでなんとかなる\n(さすがに金田朋子さんみたいな声は別ですが…)","ts":"1635485134.045300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FY8L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2765d55d-5d92-4083-a16e-8b7f985c47e1","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"声質(マイク乗りの良さ)は後天的に鍛えられるものですが、それも理解力と思考と感覚を同期させる能力が必要なので、この人の言っていることはよくわかる","ts":"1635485014.043100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"svLQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2935d578-2035-45ce-93b7-21fe58807fce","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"同じゲーム実況でもVtuber(決して悪い声ではない)と、声優さんとだと驚くほど声の入り方が違うの実感してしまってから、↑のように考えるようになった。","ts":"1635484435.041300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1fYAg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5c036c8-d6a3-433f-8410-6add8c8652a2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"理解力は後天的に補足できるからさ、声優ともなるとやっぱ声の良さ(ユニークさ)が支配的になるってわけよ。","ts":"1635484360.040000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KQa0a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6bd6cfb-2c77-43f3-ba79-43d4a0488fa4","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"考えさせられる","ts":"1635478961.039000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lKC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38942f83-b742-467e-92c2-af06275a6dd2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://anond.hatelabo.jp/20211011181250|https://anond.hatelabo.jp/20211011181250\u003e","ts":"1635478957.038700","attachments":[{"fallback":"はてな匿名ダイアリー: 声優になれる人、なれない人の違い","id":1,"title":"声優になれる人、なれない人の違い","title_link":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/20211011181250","text":"はじめにこの投稿は比較的若手の声優が書いています。また、個人的な意見ですので正しいと思うかは各自の判断でお願いします。簡単な自己紹介…","thumb_url":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/images/og-image-1500.gif","blocks":null,"service_name":"はてな匿名ダイアリー","thumb_width":1500,"thumb_height":1000,"from_url":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/20211011181250","original_url":"https://anond.hatelabo.jp/20211011181250"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Xbba"}]}]
